\v 8 The¦111701 warriors from Yehudah¦111703 attacked¦111700 Yerushalem¦111704 and¦111705 captured¦111705 the¦111708 city, killing the¦111710 inhabitants and¦111711 setting the¦111713 city¦111713 on fire¦111715.
\v 9 Then¦111717 they¦111718 fought¦111721 against¦111722 the Canaanites¦111722 who¦111723 lived¦111723 in the¦111724 hill¦111724 country¦111724, in the¦111725 southern \add wilderness\add*, and¦111726 in the¦111726 \add western\add* foothills.
