\p
\v 16 The Kenites¦111849 (descendants of¦111850 Mosheh's¦111851 father-in-law¦111850), left¦111852 the¦111853 city¦111853 of¦111853 palm¦111854 trees¦111854 \add !(Yeriho/Jericho)\add* and went with¦111855 Yehudah's¦111858 descendants to the¦111859 southern wilderness¦111859 near Arad¦111863 and lived¦111865 with¦111866 the¦111868 people¦111868 \add there\add*.
