\v 27 \add ≈However\add* Menashsheh's¦112061 \add descendants\add* didn't¦112058 drive out those living in Beyt¦112064-Shan¦112066, Taanak¦112072, Dor¦112080, Yibleam, or Meggidon, because the¦112099 Canaanites¦112099 were¦112098 determined¦112098 \add ≈to¦112100 keep living¦112100 there\add*.\x + \xo 1:27-28: \xt Josh 17:11-13.\x*
