\v 6 They¦112807 took¦112807 their daughters as wives¦112812, and¦112813 gave¦112816 their own daughters \add to be married\add* to¦112817 their¦112817 sons¦112817, and¦112818 they¦112818 \add ≈worshipped¦112818\add* their¦112821 gods¦112821.
