\v 1 Some days¦119781 later during¦119782 the¦119782 wheat¦119785 harvest¦119783, Shimshon¦119787 visited¦119786 his¦119790 wife¦119790 with¦119791 a¦119791 young goat¦119792 \add as a present for the family, because\add* he¦119793 said¦119793, “I'll go¦119794 into¦119795 the¦119798 bedroom¦119798 with my wife.” \add ≈But¦119799\add* her¦119802 father¦119802 wouldn't allow¦119801 him¦119801 to¦119803 go¦119803 in,
