\v 20 And¦120157 \add so\add* \add @Shimshon¦120157\add* led¦120157 Yisrael¦120160 for twenty¦120163 years¦120164 at the¦120161 time¦120161 of¦120161 the¦120162 Philistine \add oppression\add*.
